; units/infantry.spr: melee, archer and recon lines (docs/ART.md 10.2-10.4).
; 24x24 box, feet at 11,21 (huge: 32x32, feet 15,29), facing east, moonlight from the upper left.
; Owner slots # % * on cloth, @ the accent (faith or sphere colour). Outlines are part of the sprite;
; the renderer adds the moon rim and contact shadow; units/stack.js the standard and the other overlays.

